            "text": "<p>We love this remarkable time in history, a kind of prelude to the slightly less exotic ‘gap year’ of today.<br/><br/>What an experience a young gentleman would have in the late 17th to early 19th century if he was from a wealthy family. He would spend several years, after his formal education was done, travelling through Europe with his entourage. Beginning in Dover and spending considerable time in Paris and Switzerland, travelling through the Alps and onto the cultural mecca of Italy. Learning languages </p>",
